AT 3rd occurrence          6
ATC case-insensitive, 2nd occurrence          4
ATCC is ATC on a single-byte code page          4
AT_C is AT on a single-byte code page          6
RAT with no occurrence is the last one         11
RAT 2nd occurrence from the end          8
RATC is case-sensitive, unlike its name's C          0

AT occurrence 0 is error 11, not occurrence 1         11
GETWORDCOUNT with the default delimiters          6
GETWORDCOUNT split only on commas          3
GETWORDNUM the 3rd word by default BBB
GETWORDNUM by comma keeps the leading space [ BBB bbb]
GETWORDNUM past the last word is empty []
